  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1c1503a31fab35743b89392ed00651c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  familyMembers:
  - name: Grandma
    dayPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1bfea8001b6b44c4c90c54d7d6db30e9, type: 3}
    nightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0b196a9ad47ea16448748534f753635d, type: 3}
    dayDescriptions:
    - "She\u2019s so mean now, what happened to her?\r\n"
    - How is she taking a walk?
    nightDescriptions:
    - 
  - name: 'Father '
    dayPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d4b5ed4f0c683e74a8bed0bd574376e2, type: 3}
    nightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85662ddea8cb12a41a0b01d931e9fed2, type: 3}
    dayDescriptions:
    - Why is he not at work anymore?
    - Father threatened me.
    nightDescriptions:
    - "Father is sleeping, i can\u2019t make any noise. But his breathing changes
      when i step too close. Is he pretending???"
    - I know what you did...
  - name: Aunt
    dayPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5c33659e767f2b7419999502d98c9a14, type: 3}
    nightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1795c99d8cdbcc04d94cdc20719a90ef, type: 3}
    dayDescriptions:
    - Why does she stand in the kitchen all day? What about her studies?
    - Is she standing guard over the trapdoor to the pantry?
    nightDescriptions:
    - 'Did she kill Casper? But no... This doesn''t make any sense. '
    - Woof-Woof!
  - name: Grandpa
    dayPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2d2d8eb13efb8654e958d57a098fe5dd, type: 3}
    nightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ec96fc63863b1054d96c74c38e8ba5e0, type: 3}
    dayDescriptions:
    - "Usually I don\u2019t see him until after noon. Why is he up so early?"
    - He should not let grandma take a walk.
    nightDescriptions:
    - 'Don''t look away...

'
    - '1 SA!6 D@O&Nt Lo#k 4W...

'
  - name: Younger Brother
    dayPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0bb0ff42f8b789c40994cd47d63c7260, type: 3}
    nightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5e6e3c7480652ea439fe46e29397bce1, type: 3}
    dayDescriptions:
    - Why does he not care about Casper? They used to be almost glued together.
    - "Casper is dead. And he doesn\u2019t care."
    nightDescriptions:
    - Casper died because of you!
    - MURDERER!!!
  - name: Older Brother
    dayPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 06a5c796bc5962743bba30c049f6dcc9, type: 3}
    nightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7b0ecf7ff5fa5a945a81965b5bae5bb7, type: 3}
    dayDescriptions:
    - Does his leg not hurt anymore? I thought the doctor said it was permanently
      disfigured.
    - "He doesn\u2019t remember the injury. You\u2019d think a life ruining injury
      would be memorable. \r\n"
    nightDescriptions:
    - 
  - name: Mother
    dayPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 43af88c6cb73f5a41a2565dd76b9cc0b, type: 3}
    nightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 332523c4f96d5f34c80bcec1e1ce3211, type: 3}
    dayDescriptions:
    - I never told her I was in the pantry
    - 'Mother is lying. She scares me.

      

'
    nightDescriptions:
    - "She comforts me like nothing happened. Her voice is warm, but her face doesn\u2019t
      move right. When I blink, she\u2019s closer than before."
  - name: Casper
    dayPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 71aa17ce927571c47b08128f093de2fa, type: 3}
    nightPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 332523c4f96d5f34c80bcec1e1ce3211, type: 3}
    dayDescriptions:
    - WOOOOF-Woof-wof
    - I haven't seen Casper today. I wonder where he is.
    nightDescriptions:
    - '....

'
  portraitUI: {fileID: 2094240867}
  nameUI: {fileID: 436615517}
  typewriter: {fileID: 1952938303}
